{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026HySQW4nBpm1792854645.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>中國航母遼寧艦編隊驅趕日本艦機的片段曝光。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.CN.CARRIER-2300_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026SzvYnfGryB1792854662.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>央視披露遼寧艦編隊早前赴西太平洋相關海域，進行遠海實戰化訓練的細節。報道指，日本艦機曾多次接近，滋擾挑釁。中方的殲-15艦載機有效攔截日方的P-3C反潛機，而中方一艘護衛艦全程在遠距離驅離日方艦艇。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.CN.CARRIER-2300_003.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026axo5uFvfAV1792854676.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>片段中還見到中方的加油機替艦載機加油，以及轟炸機進行打擊船隻的演練。這次遠海訓練歷時40多天，是遼寧艦入列以來時間最長的遠海訓練。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.CN.CARRIER-2300_002.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026qmv40ZATGh1792854688.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-24T16:01:09.781710+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":187,"images":4,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-24T14:43:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-25T00:38:39.184389+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-24T15:58:14.461690+00:00","content_hash":"695a35da60c6149171bb02e9576f40ef345599cb0a542732fa21d1260568281c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-24T16:01:09.781710+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}